OL,3,AWe have a duty to 'progress' Good
OL,4,AFriday Agreement, taoiseach tells PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister said they were
OL,7,F"working together" to uphold the
OL,8,Fprinciples of the peace deal for
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland.
